Highlights

* Command Router HTTP API (#1146)
* Initial HTTP server infrastructure for the command router (#1156)
* Async HTTP API with CommandExecution (#1165)
* In-process routing of HTTP commands through BusCommandRouterProcessor (#1168)
* Synchronous get/set execution on POST /command-router/executions (#1175)
* Stream query answers as JSON over the Command Router HTTP API (#1197)
* Attention Focus Strictness — new ATTENTION_FOCUS_STRICTNESS parameter for pattern-matching queries (#1158, #1160)
* QueryAnswer path hops — new QueryAnswerElement to retrieve hops in query-answer paths (#1154)
* Link creation criteria revised (#1009) (#1147)
* db_loader main entry point added (#1142)
* RemoteDB fixes and improvements (part 1/2) (#1155)
* AtomDB::composite_type_enabled() added (#1181)
* SQL column value sanitization (#1152)
* Release query-engine memory back to the OS via malloc_trim (#1171)

